  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exit of NTP Turkmenistan from the Global Fund support by 2021 - Turkmenistan (01-Jul-2018-30-Jun-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkmenistan, Tuberculosis, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Turkmenistan)This program has the following goals: To enable successful transition and strengthen the sustainability of the Global Fund TB grant in Turkmenistan through progressive government co-financing of all key interventions by 2021. The objectives of this program are: To advance policies and capacities for the successful transition to full domestic funding of the TB grant.  To ensure the sustainability of universal access to TB prevention, diagnosis and treatment services of good quality and applying patient-centered strategic interventions during the transition period</narrative>
  </description>
